Z||000005||fierospeeder||12-24-2001||09:23 PM||||i build my desk on my own.<BR>It WAS 8 feet by 2'8" wide.  I did cut it about 6-9 inches.  So now its about 7'6" long.<P>Its made out of oak, and two file cabinets support the desk.  I built it using my aunt's bf's idea.  <P>I also built a shelf that just sits on the desk.  About 5 feet long.  It has a 4 ft florescent light.  Which is very nice..  <P>I have tons of car magazines sitting on the desk, and a lot of papers and receipts that i havn't organized yet.<P>My puter is home built.  Abit board and a 350 pentium.  Two harddrives, in a full tower.  I haven't upgraded yet, cause all my money is going into my fieros.  The speed is fine.  I dont think computers are going to get any faster in the future.  Unless were gonna be going into full video windows.||||reg||1
Z||000006||ray b||12-24-2001||09:28 PM||||an old door off a inside room[hollow]<BR>on top of two small book cases<BR>narrow but long so there is room for printer, scanner, mid tower, and monitor<BR>plus phone, drawing tablit, mouse pad, ect.<BR>with room under ends for big stereo speakers<P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
